      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 hiring is happening through a pool campus drive in Ahmedabad on 12 December 2026 for BE/B.Tech graduates of the 2025 and 2026 batches. The job is in Micron&rsquo;s Sanand assembly and test plant, the stated package is &#8377;5.50 LPA plus benefits, and shortlisted candidates hear back by email or WhatsApp on or before 7 December.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Micron Technology (Micron Technology Operations India)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Role</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Graduate Engineering Technician (Assembly &amp; Test)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Drive type</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Pool campus drive, physical assessment</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Drive date</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">12 December 2026</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Venue</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Ahmedabad, Gujarat (exact address not published; shared with shortlisted candidates)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Job location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Micron plant, Sanand, Gujarat</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Eligibility</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">BE/B.Tech, 2025 and 2026 pass-outs, age 18+, no active backlogs</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Branches</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Electrical, Electronics, Mechanical, Mechatronics, Mining, Industrial, Production, Metallurgy, Instrumentation</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Salary</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Stated on form: &#8377;5.50 LPA + benefits | Reported: &#8377;3&ndash;6 LPA (job listings); &#8377;5.5&ndash;7.7 LPA (AmbitionBox, Micron technicians, 4 reports)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Selection</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Written test, then interview</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Organised by</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Cosmos Manpower Pvt Ltd (named as Micron&rsquo;s recruitment partner); no fee</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_role\" >What you will do in the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_eligibility\" >Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_selection_process\" >Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Expected_salary_for_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_drive\" >Expected salary for the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 drive</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Documents_required\" >Documents required</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_written_test\" >Preparation tips for the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 written test</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#How_to_apply_for_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026\" >How to apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#About_Micron_Technology\" >About Micron Technology</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 pool drive is a single-day hiring event for engineering graduates who want to start on the shop floor of a semiconductor plant. Candidates from several colleges register through one online form, the recruiter shortlists them, and only shortlisted people travel to Ahmedabad on 12 December 2026 for the written test and interview.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The registration form is run by Cosmos Manpower Pvt Ltd, which describes itself on the form as the recruitment partner of Micron Technology. The drive was also shared on LinkedIn by a member whose profile lists Micron. Selected candidates join Micron&rsquo;s assembly, test, marking and packaging facility at Sanand, near Ahmedabad.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FDEBEA;border-left:5px solid #C8372B;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#5B1A14;\"><strong>Branch filter:</strong> the form lists only Electrical, Electronics, Mechanical, Mechatronics, Mining, Industrial, Production, Metallurgy and Instrumentation streams. Computer Science and IT are not on the list, and B.Sc, diploma and MCA candidates are not eligible for this drive.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Check before you register:</strong> the form asks for your Aadhaar number, Aadhaar address and CV, and records your Google account. It also offers a 2027 batch option even though the drive text says 2025 and 2026 only, so 2027 students should not expect a call. You must agree to shift work and relocation, and an active backlog found after selection cancels the offer. Micron and its partner charge no fee; never pay anyone for a slot.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_role\"></span>What you will do in the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The form links a job profile document but does not spell out duties in its text. Based on how assembly and test plants run, a Graduate Engineering Technician at Sanand typically handles:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Running and monitoring production equipment on the assembly and test lines</li>\n<li>First-level troubleshooting of machine alarms and escalating to engineers</li>\n<li>Recording output, yield and downtime data in factory systems</li>\n<li>Following cleanroom, ESD and safety rules on every shift</li>\n<li>Supporting preventive maintenance and process checks</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_eligibility\"></span>Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>BE or B.Tech degree, 2025 or 2026 year of passing</li>\n<li>One of the nine listed engineering streams</li>\n<li>Age 18 years or above on the drive date</li>\n<li>No pending or uncleared backlogs</li>\n<li>Willing to work in rotating shifts and relocate to the Ahmedabad&ndash;Sanand area</li>\n<li>Able to attend the 12 December assessment in person</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">For the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 drive, a minimum CGPA is <strong>not stated</strong>. The form asks for your CGPA, so expect it to be used for shortlisting. Experienced candidates can register, but the role is pitched at freshers.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_selection_process\"></span>Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 process has two rounds named on the form. Shortlisting happens first, and the notice goes out on email or WhatsApp on or before 7 December 2026.</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li><strong>Online registration</strong> &mdash; fill in the Google Form with your CV</li>\n<li><strong>Shortlist</strong> &mdash; message by 7 December if selected</li>\n<li><strong>Written test</strong> &mdash; expect aptitude, basic electrical and mechanical concepts, and English</li>\n<li><strong>Interview</strong> &mdash; technical basics from your branch, shift readiness and communication</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Expected_salary_for_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_drive\"></span>Expected salary for the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 drive<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">In the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 drive, the form states a package of &#8377;5.50 LPA plus benefits. For comparison, job listings for the same Sanand title show &#8377;3&ndash;6 LPA, and AmbitionBox shows &#8377;5.5&ndash;7.7 LPA for Micron technicians based on only 4 reports. Treat the reported figures as market estimates and ask for the CTC break-up in writing.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required\"></span>Documents required<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Aadhaar card, driving licence or school leaving certificate as age proof (any one)</li>\n<li>Updated CV or resume (upload on the form, carry printed copies)</li>\n<li>Degree or provisional certificate and mark sheets</li>\n<li>Passport-size photos</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Need a clean one-page CV? Build one with our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a>.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026_written_test\"></span>Preparation tips for the Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 written test<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Revise quantitative aptitude, ratios, percentages and logical reasoning</li>\n<li>Brush up on basic circuits, sensors, measurement and machine basics from your branch</li>\n<li>Read about how chips are assembled, tested and packed</li>\n<li>Practise a short spoken introduction in English</li>\n<li>Be ready to explain why you are comfortable with night shifts</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Use our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">career tools</a> for practice and our guide on <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self introduction for interview</a> for the HR round.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Micron_Graduate_Engineering_Technician_2026\"></span>How to apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Open the official <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdpRbkpOjM0vOnxC7RwFRwS0KdQ9S1kZUzJTWN3D1iSIzBeDA/viewform\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Micron pool campus drive registration form</a></li>\n<li>Fill in your name exactly as on Aadhaar, WhatsApp number and email</li>\n<li>Choose your stream, batch and CGPA honestly</li>\n<li>Upload your CV and confirm physical attendance on 12 December</li>\n<li>Submit, then watch email and WhatsApp until 7 December</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdpRbkpOjM0vOnxC7RwFRwS0KdQ9S1kZUzJTWN3D1iSIzBeDA/viewform\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026 &rarr;</strong></a></p>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\">More Micron openings: <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-technician-apprentice-2026/\">Micron Technician Apprentice 2026</a>, <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-off-campus-drive-2026/\">Micron Off Campus Drive 2026</a> and <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-technology-freshers-hiring-2026/\">Micron Technology Freshers Hiring 2026</a>. See all <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">companies hiring freshers</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Micron_Technology\"></span>About Micron Technology<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Micron Technology is a US-based maker of memory and storage chips such as DRAM and NAND. Its Sanand unit in Gujarat assembles and tests memory products, which is why most fresher roles there are on the manufacturing floor and run in shifts.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the salary for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The registration form states &#8377;5.50 LPA plus benefits. Reported figures are &#8377;3&ndash;6 LPA on job listings and &#8377;5.5&ndash;7.7 LPA on AmbitionBox for Micron technicians (4 reports).</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Which batches can apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">BE and B.Tech graduates of the 2025 and 2026 batches, aged 18 or above, from the listed electrical, electronics, mechanical and allied streams, with no active backlogs.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Can CSE or IT students apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">No. Computer Science and IT are not among the streams listed on the registration form for this pool drive.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Where is the drive and where is the job?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">The assessment is in Ahmedabad on 12 December 2026; the exact venue is shared with shortlisted candidates. The job is at Micron&rsquo;s Sanand plant in Gujarat.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I apply for Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Register on the Google Form run by Cosmos Manpower, Micron&rsquo;s recruitment partner. Shortlisted candidates get an email or WhatsApp message on or before 7 December 2026.</p>\n</details>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdpRbkpOjM0vOnxC7RwFRwS0KdQ9S1kZUzJTWN3D1iSIzBeDA/viewform\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Graduate Engineering Technician (Assembly & Test)\",\"description\":\"Pool campus drive for BE/B.Tech 2025 and 2026 graduates in Electrical, Electronics, Mechanical, Mechatronics, Mining, Industrial, Production, Metallurgy and Instrumentation streams. Assessment in Ahmedabad on 12 December 2026: written test and interview. Job at Micron's Sanand, Gujarat plant, shift work.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Micron Technology\",\"value\":\"Pool Campus Drive Ahmedabad 12-Dec-2026\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-11-24\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Micron Technology\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.micron.com\",\"logo\":\"https://www.micron.com/favicon.ico\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Sanand\",\"addressRegion\":\"Gujarat\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"baseSalary\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"value\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"value\":550000,\"unitText\":\"YEAR\"}},\"educationRequirements\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"bachelor degree\"},\"experienceRequirements\":\"no requirements\",\"directApply\":false}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"headline\":\"Micron Graduate Engineering Technician 2026: Pool Campus Drive on 12 Dec in Ahmedabad\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00+05:30\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00+05:30\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Freshershunt\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://freshershunt.in/favicon.ico\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://freshershunt.in/micron-graduate-engineering-technician-2026/\"}</script><br />